        "page": 14,
        "paragraph": 3,
        "block": 3,
        "text": "i.\n小分子CDMO 管线持续扩张。"
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:7e2fa8a2d699e74d8f84d9387f165fdef25e4fae43a814bb8ed3b9a7885d6f52",
        "page": 14,
        "paragraph": 4,
        "block": 3,
        "text": "2025 年小分子D&M 业务收入199.2 亿元，同比增长\n11.4%。"
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:8df09fa473c50f5f1902984b1bdb94e0760b6210d867b6bfa285a66f4f192ef8",
        "page": 14,
        "paragraph": 5,
        "block": 3,
        "text": "2025 年，小分子D&M 管线累计新增839 个分子。"
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:1f1c2586a9ee33c61dd332ccde368082cbdac29fa89a6d1edd892cd9be9fede2",
        "page": 14,
        "paragraph": 6,
        "block": 3,
        "text": "截至2025 年末，小分子\nD&M 管线总数达到3,452 个，包括83 个商业化项目, 91 个临床III 期项目，377 个\n临床II 期项目, 2,901 个临床前和临床I 期项目。"
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:12f76a1611dd72e1fa227686f2c61dea15606a3bcac7c5693ceb29c7bb8f44bc",
        "page": 14,
        "paragraph": 7,
        "block": 3,
        "text": "商业化和临床III 期阶段项目全年\n增加22 个。"
      },
