        "page": 13,
        "paragraph": 21,
        "block": 16,
        "text": "(1) 化学业务实现收入人民币364.7 亿元，同比增长25.5%。"
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:fa43554a66f056d60898d31c27e3fb28d4552be0e7116ffebc3d91487deb7697",
